cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this task in research, please cite it as below and name it in your Methods section."
type: software
title: "Room Recall Task: an object recognition memory task for colored-noise research"
abstract: >-
  An object recognition memory task for in-lab studies. Participants study a
  rendered basement holding photos of everyday objects, complete a short filled
  delay, then pick the objects they saw from a grid with decoys. Runs on PsychoPy or
  pygame, with counterbalanced conditions, manipulation checks and per-tile
  recognition data.
